The text of the acts in this repository is not protected by copyright. Section 7(1) of the Austrian Copyright Act
(Urheberrechtsgesetz, BGBl. Nr. 111/1936) reads:

    Gesetze, Verordnungen, amtliche Erlässe und Bekanntmachungen sowie Entscheidungen genießen keinen
    urheberrechtlichen Schutz.

("Laws, regulations, official decrees and notices, and decisions enjoy no copyright protection.")

Source of the text and of its metadata: Rechtsinformationssystem des Bundes (RIS), Bundesrecht konsolidiert, operated
by the Bundeskanzleramt (Federal Chancellery of the Republic of Austria), through its Open Government Data interface
(https://data.bka.gv.at/ris/api/v2.6/ and https://ogd.ris.bka.gv.at). The RIS OGD FAQ (28 November 2025) states:
"Die Nutzung der RIS Daten via OGD erfolgt gemäß der Namensnennung 4.0 International - Creative Commons
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.de); beachten Sie daher die erforderliche Namensnennung." It gives no
fixed attribution wording. Ours:

    Quelle: Rechtsinformationssystem des Bundes (RIS), Bundeskanzleramt, https://www.ris.bka.gv.at, lizenziert unter
    CC BY 4.0. Rearranged into one file per provision with white space normalised; no words changed.

The RIS states that no guarantee is given for the correctness, currency or completeness of the data, that no legal
claims can be derived from their use, and that only the Federal Law Gazette (Bundesgesetzblatt) is authentic.

Everything else in this repository (the history as commits, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

To the extent possible under law, Lexifina has waived all copyright and related or neighbouring rights to this work.
